                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.79611 Pan American Airways, Inc./184:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the High Commissioner in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-12-17T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>88. The Department approves of the suggestion in the last paragraph of your
                    despatch 1327, November 28.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
